@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174

### GET All Services
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/service
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### POST Create Service
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/service
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test"
}


### DELETE Service
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/service/64b9c53d-f5f4-4621-8af1-daeb8a4f9638
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}